#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of gegl"
msgstr "Instalação do gegl"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are installing over a previous version of "
"<application>gegl</application>, one of the modules will need to be removed."
"  As the &root; user, run the following command to remove it:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver instalando sobre uma versão anterior do "
"<application>gegl</application>, um dos módulos precisará ser removido. Como"
" o(a) usuário(a) &root;, execute o seguinte comando para removê-lo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:155
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -f /usr/lib/gegl-0.4/vector-fill.so</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -f /usr/lib/gegl-0.4/vector-fill.so</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>gegl</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>gegl</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:170
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To run the tests, issue: <command>ninja test</command>. Fourteen tests are "
"known to fail in the <filename>gegl:ff-load-save</filename> portion of the "
"test suite due to incompatibilities with recent versions of ffmpeg."
msgstr ""
"Para executar os testes, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Catorze "
"testes são conhecidos por falharem na parte <filename>gegl:ff-load-"
"save</filename> da suíte de teste devido a incompatibilidades com versões "
"recentes do ffmpeg."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/gegl.xml:186
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

